\begin_inset Formula $\exists\ \{A,B\}\subseteq\mathcal{B}^{W},\ \exists\ \{x,x^{\prime}\}\subseteq A\cap B:\left[x\in C(A)\ \wedge\ x^{\prime}\in C(B)\right]\ \wedge\ x\notin C(B)$
