, then 
\begin_inset Formula $x\neq x^{\prime}$
\end_inset

.
 So, we have 
\begin_inset Formula $p^{\prime}\cdot x<1$
\end_inset

 and 
\begin_inset Formula $x\neq x^{\prime}$
\end_inset

, which implies that 
\begin_inset Formula $p\cdot x^{\prime}>1$
