\begin_layout Case
\begin_inset Formula $s\cdot x(s^{\prime},1)=1$
\end_inset

.
 By Walras' Law, 
\begin_inset Formula $s^{\prime}\cdot x(s^{\prime},1)=1$
\end_inset

 and 
